# SoftMedia Specific
# Anchored to the repo root: this ignores the top-level runtime media folder ONLY.
# Without the leading slash, "media/" also matched source directories named Media
# (e.g. src/SoftMedia.Server/Services/Media) — case-insensitively on Windows — which
# silently hid newly-added source files there from git.
/media/
data/
*.db
*.db-shm
*.db-wal
transcode-temp/
**/cache/
**/wwwroot/cache/
test-fixtures/

# Test / build output noise (never commit; see Phase 2 / E1 of the hardening plan)
**/build*.log
**/build_*.txt
**/test_log*.txt
**/test_run_*.txt
**/test_build_*.txt
**/errors.log
